#
# imagetoraster.convs — image -> CUPS raster MIME conversion rules
#
# Bundled from cups-filters 1.28.17 (mime/cupsfilters.convs), TRIMMED to only the
# rules whose target filter we actually ship on Android: `imagetoraster`
# (jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libcupsf_imagetoraster.so, symlinked as
# ServerBin/filter/imagetoraster by start_cups_server). CUPS 2.x moved the input
# filters out of core into cups-filters, so without these rules cupsd rejects
# "unsupported document format image/jpeg".
#
# These map raster-input image types straight to application/vnd.cups-raster,
# which the DNP PPD's `*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100
# rastertogutenprint.5.3"` then hands to the Gutenprint dye-sub chain.
#
# The imagetopdf / rastertopdf / pdftoraster / gstoraster rules from the full
# cupsfilters.convs are DELIBERATELY OMITTED: those filters (and their PDF
# renderers — poppler/ghostscript) are NOT bundled (licensing constraint), so
# referencing them would only make cupsd log "Filter ... not found".
#
# The source image MIME types (image/jpeg, image/png, image/gif, image/tiff,
# image/x-bitmap, image/x-portable-*, ...) are already defined in the CUPS core
# mime.types shipped alongside this file.
#
# Format: source/type  destination/type  cost  filter
#

image/gif			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/png			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/jpeg			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/tiff			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-bitmap			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-photocd			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-portable-anymap		application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-portable-bitmap		application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-portable-graymap	application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-portable-pixmap		application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-sgi-rgb			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-xbitmap			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-xpixmap			application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
image/x-sun-raster		application/vnd.cups-raster	100	imagetoraster
